recommendations:
STEP 7 — Don't:
- write AppleLanguages (not API, per Apple DTS);
- use generateLocaleConfig;
- store the choice in CachesDirectoryPath;
- use I18nManager.localeIdentifier as the language (Android-only, read once, application context on ≤12);
- set CFBundleAllowMixedLocalizations;
- call setApplicationLocales off the main thread.
Optionally harden device-country.ts to take its Android locale region from AuraAppLocale.getSystemLocales()[0], because per-app tags have no region.
